{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2f6db3397276d8a3111e3dd8c5f183756355a76674dcf4355c744d8f216b347e", "ja": "（来週は水着ファッションショーだ。本番までに\n準備を進めないとな……ん？　この声は静香か？）", "zh": "（下周就是泳装时装秀了。得在正式演出前做好准备才行……嗯？这个声音是静香吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "9c48b75ec87e286f2126703f82c68b154c0f11dbe9d2e2d772c695f13ee69cab", "ja": "29……30……。\nよし、もう一セット！", "zh": "29……30……。\n好，再来一组！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1003_p", "source_sha256": "80122ed0e11533d06151e7faf30708fda7d5b08e90cdcc04470ea14ca60d8d61", "ja": "やっぱり静香だったか。お疲れさま。\nひとりで自主練か？", "zh": "果然是静香啊。辛苦了。\n是一个人自主练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "1c155b0851b5fe78090455f6256b32bf132784c219a5893c99bae33cf1c356fc", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\n自主練というか、その……筋トレをしようと思って。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n与其说是自主练习，其实是那个……我想做肌肉训练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1005_p", "source_sha256": "405ec945f417947caf48879002e260a0aadfab9fd602e3ac9b1cdbc8a8569395", "ja": "筋トレ？\nあっ。もしかして……！", "zh": "肌肉训练？\n啊，难道……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "d7e11ae11243c2ed93f527b26e1c2aa898921275c60a39d93c9ddb5c8293587e", "ja": "うっ……やっぱり、わかりますか？\nそうです、水着ファッションショーのためです。", "zh": "呜……果然还是被看出来了吗？\n没错，是为了泳装时装秀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "432d352f414cb07e5cda994d0d98131b42e86cb27b3b03f015bd1dfedcbe60de", "ja": "当日は大勢の方がいらっしゃるみたいですし、\nだらしない姿を見せるわけにはいかないですから。", "zh": "当天好像会有很多人来，\n我可不能让人看到自己不得体的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ae1afde78740f947dc63d197b8cf7c3a671abbab9f8ed4ec723345157565f347", "ja": "そうだったのか。でもそこまで気にしなくてもいいと\n思うけどな。静香はスタイルがいいから。", "zh": "原来是这样。不过我觉得也不用那么在意吧。静香的身材很好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "7e3067e65303189743365aed2374bcc79f71ef794051339f62186a3d7f8b4e2d", "ja": "へっ！？\n{$P$}、そんな風に……。", "zh": "诶！？\n{$P$}，怎么能这样说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1010_p", "source_sha256": "744c5d5bc5770699833283315293276ab6deebc4774b69582f0449f0e9d24abf", "ja": "ん？　静香？", "zh": "嗯？静香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "741abc822bfdef2ee30d593bf1768d068b03c96760e567d6dd1308003f9bc840", "ja": "い、いえ。とにかく！　本番までは筋トレを続けて、\n食生活にも気をつけて。出来ることをするつもりです！", "zh": "没、没什么。总而言之！在正式演出前我会坚持肌肉锻炼，\n饮食方面也会多加注意。尽自己所能去做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b8c412ce1c13093de74b9c483532cf8885a5a48f0a9220d1a31bf4c6cf38d7a4", "ja": "ははっ、わかったよ。無理はしないようにな。\nでも、そうか……そういうことなら……。", "zh": "哈哈，知道了。可别勉强自己啊。\n不过，这样吗……既然是这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "18bdafe5ed94acc083f8acc84c29592beb81891096823a74da166c8b83ba77be", "ja": "{$P$}、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}，有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e002f65b437e4528585daaa0ddce28c8a4ad5b1540b5df8508cbe128855c63bd", "ja": "実は、新しいうどん屋さんを見つけてね。\n静香を誘おうと……。", "zh": "其实，我发现了一家新的乌冬面店。\n就想着叫上静香一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "ad350704d7062a5d3616931c8af4aa6fb034374cdf59de4b40b1b9c1fdb4e334", "ja": "えっ、どこですか！？　行きたい、ですけど……。\nうどん……でも炭水化物……ううっ……。", "zh": "咦，在哪里！？我想去，不过……乌冬面……可是碳水化合物……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d0d8ed903fdaadb534a4a0bf15afb525e25bb4c5035fd07c95e1a40f03666978", "ja": "……タイミングが悪かったな。うん、すまん。\nこの仕事が終わったら、一緒に行こう。", "zh": "……时机不太巧。嗯，抱歉。\n等这份工作结束后，我们一起去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "253290cf3f9a4b852fa8b257439ea86b622cac5b9780f957cae88d748cc319af", "ja": "ううっ、そうですね……。本当は今すぐにでも行きたい\nですけど。これもお仕事のため……が、我慢します！", "zh": "呜……是啊……其实我现在就想去，\n不过这也是为了工作……我、我会忍住的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "a4a2114c12371b5f37216115d254310a8416be1f3213e99372d1d121159e1744", "ja": "だから、お仕事が終わったら連れて行ってくださいね！\n絶対に！　約束ですよっ！", "zh": "所以，工作结束后请带我去哦！\n一定要！说好了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0423_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4664b1d6ea91fb70222dc0e6e85b51565be8d0a4bc4a58847b5713db53c86718", "ja": "（ファッションショーが終わり、約束通りうどん屋に\n行った。静香も満足したようで、安心した……ホッ）", "zh": "（时装秀结束后，按照约定带她去了乌冬面店。静香看起来也很满足，我放心了……呼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
